# P3: ALL05 (Dark Night) WON with real orders only (no cheats). Generated by gen/mk_all05.py.
# Tanya (house 1, PlayerControl) and the three Spies (house 2) are the player's
# forces. The two Soviet nuclear silos (YellowTeam 6 / OrangeTeam 7) sit inside
# wall rings guarded by Tesla Coils; every base also has a Tesla Reactor
# (NANRCT, off the playable area) that only turns neutral ('No Power Plants')
# when the base has no Tesla Power Plant (NAPOWR) left.
#
#  1. The spies disguise as a Conscript; spy 0 enters a RedTeam power plant
#     (blackout), spy 1 re-arms it, spy 2 enters the Battle Lab (secondary
#     objective -> the map is enlarged, ResizeView).
#  2. Tanya C4s the three RedTeam power plants during the blackout -> the red
#     reactor goes neutral and the red Tesla Coils stay dark for good.
#  3. 'Spies Dead 1' flies in three fresh spies. One blacks out YellowTeam, Tanya
#     C4s the yellow silo from outside its wall ring; two black out OrangeTeam in
#     turn while Tanya walks round to the compound's west gate and C4s the orange
#     silo -> 'Victory 1' -> WON.
#
# Tanya's micro (act): shoot the nearest dog first, then the nearest enemy in
# range, else continue the order; never chase out of the leash. `repeat` keeps
# the script small (play_script.cpp expands it).
set render_every 3000
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL05s.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
wait 30
until 1500 input_locked == 0
click unit 2:SPY:0
click unit 2:SPY:1 shift
click unit 2:SPY:2 shift
click unit 4:E2:4
wait 20
click unit 2:SPY:0
click building 4:NAPOWR:1
repeat 20
if units(1,TANY) > 0 and selected_type(TANY) == 0 then click unit 1:TANY:0
if units(1,TANY) > 0 and ndog(1,TANY,0) <= 8 and umov(1,TANY,0) == 1 then click unit e:DOG:near
if units(1,TANY) > 0 and ndog(1,TANY,0) <= 8 and utgt(1,TANY,0) == -1 then click unit e:DOG:near
if units(1,TANY) > 0 and ndog(1,TANY,0) > 8 and nenemy(1,TANY,0) <= 7 and umov(1,TANY,0) == 1 then click unit e:*:near
if units(1,TANY) > 0 and ndog(1,TANY,0) > 8 and nenemy(1,TANY,0) <= 7 and utgt(1,TANY,0) == -1 then click unit e:*:near
if units(1,TANY) > 0 and ndog(1,TANY,0) > 8 and nenemy(1,TANY,0) > 7 and umov(1,TANY,0) == 0 then click cell 104 134
if units(1,TANY) > 0 and nenemy(1,TANY,0) > 6.2 and umov(1,TANY,0) == 0 and utgt(1,TANY,0) >= 0 then click cell 104 134
if units(1,TANY) > 0 and ndog(1,TANY,0) > 8 and nenemy(1,TANY,0) > 7 and umov(1,TANY,0) == 1 and utgt(1,TANY,0) >= 0 then click cell 104 134
if units(1,TANY) > 0 then wait 5
endrepeat
